WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.792
Data quality has multiple dimensions Completeness is
not the same

00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:13.039
as validity Validity is not the same as uniqueness
Timeliness

00:00:13.065 --> 00:00:18.994
asks a different question again Measure these
dimensions separately whenever

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:24.651
possible A single score can be useful for triage but
it can hide which

00:00:24.677 --> 00:00:26.664
problem actually caused the low score
